Serve live Devices and Clients inventory from the EasyMesh controller.

The stock dashboard loads packaged devices.json and clients.json samples and
also sends them again on every WebSocket reconnect. Build both lists from the
live get_network tree instead, use a leak-safe serialized native call, and
cache only the last successful live snapshot. Device/client detail and metrics
routes use the same inventory, so canned MAC addresses cannot reappear.

Values that EasyMesh does not supply remain empty or zero. This deliberately
avoids presenting demonstration RSSI, throughput, CPU, vendor, IP, or uptime
values as observations.

Its page hunks (src/rdkb-cli/static) moved to easymesh-medium's topology-ui,
which builds the page the controller image serves.
